1
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,170
Just what you'd expect from Europe's number one goalkeeper.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:07,760
Gino Hernandez.

3
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:11,720
Yes, his nickname comes from his flawless saves.

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,600
The perfect keeper.

5
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:19,520
Here are the stats for goalkeeper Hernandez.

6
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,310
W-Why is this...

7
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:28,030
Italy's goalkeeper is amazing, but so is Japan's number 10.

8
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:28,990
Yes.

9
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,740
His dribbling and Drive Shot...

10
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:36,490
He has a special style like he came from South America.

11
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:39,120
But why would a Japanese player...

12
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,250
Tsubasa.

13
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,260
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

14
00:02:12,830 --> 00:02:18,920
Tsubasa-kun dominated the midfield, but now the Italian youth

15
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:21,130
Episode 10: They're Back! The Golden Duo!

16
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,670
have taken control.

17
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:21,580
Catch!

18
00:02:22,090 --> 00:02:25,170
A curved pass from midfield.

19
00:02:25,630 --> 00:02:27,590
- Kazuo. - Okay, brother.

20
00:02:29,930 --> 00:02:34,470
The Japan team intercepts the pass with the Tachibana brothers' Space Storm.

21
00:02:34,890 --> 00:02:35,720
Tsubasa...

22
00:02:39,810 --> 00:02:43,520
Tsubasa-kun sends a curved pass over the defense.

23
00:02:43,610 --> 00:02:44,610
Nice.

24
00:02:45,270 --> 00:02:47,280
A volley shot!

25
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,240
Falcon Shot!

26
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:52,280
Yes, it's in.

27
00:02:52,370 --> 00:02:55,740
Nitta-kun's shot targets the left corner.

28
00:02:57,370 --> 00:02:59,410
What reflexes!

29
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:03,420
Goalkeeper Hernandez-kun catches it right there.

30
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:04,500
What!?

31
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,460
Catch.

32
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:08,260
Now it's Italy's turn, they're counterattacking.

33
00:03:08,340 --> 00:03:09,130
Nice.

34
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:10,260
Get out of the way.

35
00:03:11,050 --> 00:03:15,850
But Japan cuts them off comfortably with Gino's defensive strength.

36
00:03:15,930 --> 00:03:16,760
Let's go.

37
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:18,810
Tsubasa-kun takes it and...

38
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:22,020
Quickly sends a deceptive pass and runs.

39
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:23,020
Tsubasa-san!

40
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:26,900
Tsubasa-kun gets past with a one-two, what will he do now?

41
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:28,400
Come on, Tsubasa.

42
00:03:29,570 --> 00:03:31,900
Italy has now marked Hyuga-kun.

43
00:03:32,490 --> 00:03:36,080
He doesn't pass to Hyuga-kun, he backheels it.

44
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,040
What!?

45
00:03:37,410 --> 00:03:38,370
Nice!

46
00:03:38,450 --> 00:03:41,460
Soda-kun comes in with an overlapping run.

47
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:44,330
Take this. Sharp Shot!

48
00:03:44,420 --> 00:03:48,170
He shoots! Japan attacks relentlessly.

49
00:03:49,710 --> 00:03:52,760
Oh, he catches it with one hand again.

50
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,800
Damn it.

51
00:03:54,090 --> 00:03:56,600
They're attacking centered around Tsubasa-kun.

52
00:03:56,680 --> 00:04:01,430
But Italy's goalkeeper Gino Hernandez controls all shots.

53
00:04:02,730 --> 00:04:03,690
He...

54
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:08,190
Hernandez caught every single shot all year.

55
00:04:08,690 --> 00:04:11,440
He had a flawless performance last year.

56
00:04:11,530 --> 00:04:15,780
If I can't maintain my rhythm in this tournament, everything will be wasted.

57
00:04:16,990 --> 00:04:20,450
The last person to score against me...

58
00:04:20,910 --> 00:04:23,040
was Karl Heinz Schneider.

59
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:25,920
My reputation as the perfect keeper is at stake.

60
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,630
I'll settle the score for that goal with you here.

61
00:04:30,050 --> 00:04:33,550
It's very hard to score in this match.

62
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,390
Wakabayashi-kun.

63
00:04:35,590 --> 00:04:40,600
A year ago, I played against Hernandez in Hamburg.

64
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:43,480
In that match, Schneider somehow

65
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:47,520
managed to score at the last minute and we drew 1-1.

66
00:04:48,310 --> 00:04:54,240
Gino Hernandez, now I understand why he's Europe's number one goalkeeper.

67
00:04:55,990 --> 00:04:58,950
The Japan team seemed superior, but look,

68
00:04:59,030 --> 00:05:00,740
the referee's whistle signals the end of the first half.

69
00:05:01,410 --> 00:05:04,160
This is the first International Youth Tournament in France.

70
00:05:04,250 --> 00:05:09,960
In the opening match, Japan finishes the first half 0-0 against Italy.

71
00:05:10,630 --> 00:05:12,590
The fate of the match will be decided in the second half.

72
00:05:12,670 --> 00:05:15,510
I'll show them, I'll score in the second half.

73
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:18,390
You were great, Japan youth!

74
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,890
You're doing a great job against a strong opponent!

75
00:05:20,970 --> 00:05:22,640
Good luck in the second half.

76
00:05:22,970 --> 00:05:27,310
Oh, what energy and cheers are coming from the stands for the Japan team.

77
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:31,270
They held on in the first half against strong Italy.

78
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:36,360
It will be very interesting to see what they do in the second half.

79
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:40,450
According to the plan, we let them attack as much as they could.

80
00:05:40,530 --> 00:05:42,040
This game is going exactly how we wanted.

81
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:45,290
We'll get to work right at the start of the second half.

82
00:05:45,410 --> 00:05:46,660
Okay, Gino.

83
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:51,790
We attacked throughout the first half, but they are very calm.

84
00:05:52,550 --> 00:05:54,880
We can't stay calm in the second half.

85
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:58,510
Well done guys, you fought well.

86
00:05:58,840 --> 00:05:59,930
You were great.

87
00:06:00,010 --> 00:06:02,260
But I wish we could have scored at least 1 goal.

88
00:06:02,350 --> 00:06:06,850
What? We attacked a lot, I'm sure we can score in the second half.

89
00:06:06,930 --> 00:06:08,190
Right.

90
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:09,270
Listen, guys.

91
00:06:09,850 --> 00:06:11,440
We have to apply more pressure.

92
00:06:11,810 --> 00:06:14,650
Tsubasa is right, remember we're up against the Italian youth,

93
00:06:14,730 --> 00:06:18,400
one of the championship contenders in this tournament.

94
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:20,780
Focus up in the second half.

95
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:22,280
Yes, coach.

96
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:29,750
Roberto Hongo-san, did I say it right?

97
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:39,090
The break is over and both teams are back on the field.

98
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:42,300
No changes for Japan or Italy.

99
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:45,770
The second half starts with the same players.

100
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:48,730
Is Misaki not playing in the second half either?

101
00:06:48,810 --> 00:06:50,020
Misaki-kun.

102
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:52,810
Italy must attack more.

103
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:59,030
Yes, but it's almost impossible for Japan to score against Gino Hernandez.

104
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:00,910
This game

105
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:03,200
will end with 1 goal.

106
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:06,080
And the second half begins.

107
00:07:06,450 --> 00:07:09,580
Japan has possession, Tsubasa-kun passes to Sawada-kun.

108
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:13,330
What's this? Italy attacks fiercely at the start of the second half.

109
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:17,840
They suddenly took the ball from Sawada-kun.

110
00:07:18,090 --> 00:07:19,670
Good, let's go forward.

111
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,720
The real game starts now.

112
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:24,720
They're so fast! What quick short passes!

113
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:27,720
This is real Italian football.

114
00:07:27,850 --> 00:07:29,980
These fast passes...

115
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:31,980
We've gotten used to them now.

116
00:07:33,230 --> 00:07:36,730
Oh, and this is Soda-kun's sharp flip from Japan.

117
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:38,440
He collects the ball nicely.

118
00:07:38,530 --> 00:07:39,440
Great.

119
00:07:39,530 --> 00:07:41,740
Two defenders push forward.

120
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:42,990
Nice.

121
00:07:43,410 --> 00:07:47,490
Italy attacked deep into Japan's defense, meaning they have no defense.

122
00:07:47,990 --> 00:07:49,830
What happened to them?

123
00:07:50,290 --> 00:07:53,000
They don't seem to want to get back on defense at all.

124
00:07:53,580 --> 00:07:54,830
Alright, get ready.

125
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,750
A long pass from Jito-kun.

126
00:07:57,170 --> 00:07:59,630
Japan's stars are in front of the goal.

127
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:03,010
Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun managed to sneak through.

128
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:04,890
Yes, what a nice pass.

129
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:10,640
And a golden opportunity for Japan, their only opponent is Hernandez-kun.

130
00:08:10,850 --> 00:08:14,100
The two defenders pushing forward is working according to plan.

131
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:15,150
Now it's your turn Gino...

132
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:16,650
We're counting on you.

133
00:08:17,020 --> 00:08:18,900
Good, now...

134
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:22,650
Goalkeeper Hernandez-kun runs without hesitation.

135
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:26,490
Tsubasa, I'm going to the keeper, the rebound is yours.

136
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,910
Okay, Hyuga-kun.

137
00:08:32,330 --> 00:08:36,790
Oh, Hernandez-kun instantly caught the ball with one hand.

138
00:08:37,290 --> 00:08:39,210
Even though he caught the ball,

139
00:08:39,300 --> 00:08:43,300
if he holds it and steps out of the penalty area, it's a foul.

140
00:08:44,590 --> 00:08:47,260
He dropped the ball, now!

141
00:08:47,930 --> 00:08:48,890
Wow!

142
00:08:48,970 --> 00:08:52,390
Still in the air, Hernandez-kun puts on a fascinating display.

143
00:08:53,940 --> 00:08:55,690
Japan couldn't score.

144
00:08:56,060 --> 00:08:57,190
- No! - Damn it.

145
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,820
Good, let's go forward.

146
00:08:58,900 --> 00:09:01,190
Once again, Italy attacks.

147
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:07,450
Jito-kun and Soda-kun pushed forward, Japan's defensive line numbers decreased.

148
00:09:07,740 --> 00:09:09,410
That's exactly what they were expecting.

149
00:09:09,490 --> 00:09:10,450
Damn it.

150
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:17,080
This blue lightning! Italy passes like lightning.

151
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:19,460
D-Damn it!

152
00:09:19,710 --> 00:09:22,880
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun comes off his line.

153
00:09:25,170 --> 00:09:26,840
I scored.

154
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:32,850
Goal! The Italian youth score first, a brilliant fast play.

155
00:09:33,180 --> 00:09:35,480
With the counterattack started by Hernandez-kun,

156
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:38,100
they finally scored the first goal.

157
00:09:38,310 --> 00:09:40,190
We did it, we scored first.

158
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:42,110
We've already won this match now.

159
00:09:42,610 --> 00:09:45,110
Yes, everything is going according to plan.

160
00:09:45,610 --> 00:09:50,620
Japan dominated the game, but this goal was painful for them.

161
00:09:50,990 --> 00:09:55,870
Now what will Japan's captain Ozora Tsubasa-kun do?

162
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:58,880
Italy, Italy, Italy!

163
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:02,210
They fell into the trap.

164
00:10:03,130 --> 00:10:06,380
This shows that Japan is still a naive team.

165
00:10:06,590 --> 00:10:08,340
Sorry, guys.

166
00:10:08,430 --> 00:10:11,220
We got excited and pushed forward too much.

167
00:10:11,350 --> 00:10:13,850
We conceded a goal, now it's time to make up for it.

168
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:17,890
We can't concede any more goals now.

169
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,650
The only thing we can do is attack, Tsubasa.

170
00:10:21,270 --> 00:10:22,230
Yes.

171
00:10:23,110 --> 00:10:27,650
Now Japan needs to attack more.

172
00:10:28,450 --> 00:10:32,030
And when they do, that's exactly what we want.

173
00:10:33,660 --> 00:10:34,910
Misaki.

174
00:10:35,410 --> 00:10:36,540
It's your turn.

175
00:10:36,790 --> 00:10:37,910
Warm up.

176
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:40,920
Yes, coach.

177
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:45,420
Japan restarts the game.

178
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:48,930
The Japan team attacks with Tsubasa-kun at the center.

179
00:10:51,390 --> 00:10:57,140
Hurry, Tsubasa-kun, I know you get even stronger at times like this.

180
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,970
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

181
00:11:02,830 --> 00:11:04,960
Birthday: July 10, Height: 185 cm, Weight: 55 kg, Blood Type: A

182
00:11:10,970 --> 00:11:13,130
Don't give them any breathing room.

183
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:21,770
Since Italy scored 1 goal, they've tightened their defense even more.

184
00:11:22,690 --> 00:11:24,770
They won't let me get past at all.

185
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:27,400
The ball goes from Tsubasa-kun to Sawada-kun.

186
00:11:27,610 --> 00:11:28,520
Hyuga-san.

187
00:11:28,820 --> 00:11:31,650
But it's intercepted.

188
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:34,780
Italy didn't allow the ball to reach Hyuga in front of the goal.

189
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:35,820
Damn it.

190
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,530
Alright, go!

191
00:11:37,780 --> 00:11:39,540
And another long pass.

192
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:42,370
Italy is going for another counterattack.

193
00:11:42,460 --> 00:11:43,330
Get back!

194
00:11:43,410 --> 00:11:46,540
Japan transitions from offense back to defense.

195
00:11:47,250 --> 00:11:48,710
This is the second goal.

196
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:52,720
And if they attack even harder to make up for these two goals,

197
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:55,760
scoring the third goal will also be easier.

198
00:11:56,010 --> 00:12:00,220
This is the main method of Italian football.

199
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:05,060
For Japan, this is literally hell.

200
00:12:05,350 --> 00:12:06,810
Here comes the next goal.

201
00:12:07,110 --> 00:12:08,940
Impossible.

202
00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:11,320
Wakashimazu-kun makes a great save.

203
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,530
What!?

204
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:14,070
Great catch.

205
00:12:14,610 --> 00:12:16,320
I'm counting on you, Wakashimazu.

206
00:12:16,610 --> 00:12:20,790
If they score another goal, the game is over.

207
00:12:21,660 --> 00:12:22,580
Tsubasa.

208
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:27,080
The Japan team needs to equalize immediately.

209
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:30,590
But Italy has an iron-clad defense.

210
00:12:31,170 --> 00:12:32,090
Damn it.

211
00:12:36,090 --> 00:12:37,260
Here it is!

212
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:41,600
Take this, here comes the Drive Shot!

213
00:12:44,350 --> 00:12:46,350
Oh, and this...

214
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:49,770
A very long-distance long shot.

215
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:52,860
What?

216
00:12:53,110 --> 00:12:55,450
But goalkeeper Hernandez-kun...

217
00:12:55,570 --> 00:12:57,700
He flies and right in front of the goal line...

218
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:00,700
He stopped it again!

219
00:13:01,870 --> 00:13:04,200
He cut the speed of the Drive Shot with his right hand.

220
00:13:04,290 --> 00:13:06,500
And punched it with the other hand.

221
00:13:07,290 --> 00:13:09,750
Japan youth couldn't score.

222
00:13:10,130 --> 00:13:14,510
That's definitely a great shot, but it doesn't work on me anymore.

223
00:13:15,010 --> 00:13:16,510
Good, let's go forward.

224
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:19,590
And another counterattack from Italy.

225
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,140
Not while I'm here.

226
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:25,520
But Japan's key defender Matsuyama-kun gets the ball.

227
00:13:25,730 --> 00:13:27,770
Please, score.

228
00:13:28,060 --> 00:13:32,570
Since Japan conceded, their defense has been working harder.

229
00:13:32,650 --> 00:13:33,610
Guys.

230
00:13:34,820 --> 00:13:37,360
My Drive Shot isn't working.

231
00:13:37,530 --> 00:13:42,490
I have other techniques, but what should I do?

232
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,790
Can I open a path by dribbling?

233
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:47,750
But this Italian defense is too tough...

234
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:50,790
I can't get past alone.

235
00:13:51,330 --> 00:13:56,380
And then how will I score against that Hernandez?

236
00:13:57,590 --> 00:13:58,720
Tsubasa.

237
00:13:59,340 --> 00:14:03,430
The Japan team can't score against Hernandez.

238
00:14:03,890 --> 00:14:04,890
Tsubasa!

239
00:14:04,970 --> 00:14:09,520
Japan passes the ball to playmaker Tsubasa-kun.

240
00:14:10,350 --> 00:14:12,440
The ball goes out of play...

241
00:14:12,940 --> 00:14:15,190
And Japan wins a throw-in.

242
00:14:25,330 --> 00:14:27,080
Mi-Misaki-kun!

243
00:14:27,750 --> 00:14:28,910
Tsubasa-kun!

244
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:31,580
Mi-Misaki.

245
00:14:31,830 --> 00:14:34,590
Japan seems to be making a substitution.

246
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:38,840
Misaki-kun comes in for midfielder Tachibana Kazuo-kun.

247
00:14:39,090 --> 00:14:41,970
Number 11 Taro Misaki-kun enters the field.

248
00:14:42,050 --> 00:14:43,340
We're counting on you, Misaki.

249
00:14:43,430 --> 00:14:44,300
Okay.

250
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:48,470
Three years ago, at the National Inter-School Cup,

251
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:52,650
Taro Misaki-kun was one of the key members in Nankatsu's victory.

252
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:57,360
Since then, he has been living here in France because of his father's work.

253
00:14:57,610 --> 00:15:03,200
I'm finally here, I have to do my best.

254
00:15:03,700 --> 00:15:08,540
And he was specially selected for the Japan youth team.

255
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:11,910
Misaki-kun is now on the field.

256
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,370
Taro.

257
00:15:13,710 --> 00:15:15,630
We're counting on you, Misaki.

258
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:18,380
Tsubasa-kun, our first job

259
00:15:18,460 --> 00:15:21,510
is to score against goalkeeper Hernandez.

260
00:15:21,590 --> 00:15:23,130
Right, Misaki-kun.

261
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:25,390
And...

262
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:28,430
The game restarts with Misaki-kun's throw-in.

263
00:15:28,970 --> 00:15:29,890
Catch!

264
00:15:30,980 --> 00:15:31,640
Misaki!

265
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:34,900
Masao-kun immediately returns the ball to Misaki-kun.

266
00:15:35,230 --> 00:15:36,770
Good, let's go.

267
00:15:37,070 --> 00:15:39,610
I won't let a substitute get past me.

268
00:15:40,530 --> 00:15:41,860
Misaki-kun.

269
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:46,120
I am Taro Misaki.

270
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:52,290
Taro Misaki

271
00:15:46,910 --> 00:15:50,580
I'm currently living in Paris because of my father's job.

272
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,290
Thank you.

273
00:15:55,330 --> 00:15:57,790
- Good. - Pass.

274
00:16:00,090 --> 00:16:03,720
We lost again! We never win.

275
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:04,970
Really?

276
00:16:05,050 --> 00:16:08,300
This is so embarrassing, we've lost 20 straight matches.

277
00:16:10,930 --> 00:16:14,440
I can't run anymore, someone take my place.

278
00:16:14,690 --> 00:16:17,020
You're so clumsy.

279
00:16:17,110 --> 00:16:18,190
Do you mind?

280
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,190
Can I go?

281
00:16:27,950 --> 00:16:32,120
Is he dribbling past the whole team alone?

282
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:33,960
He's getting past!

283
00:16:34,290 --> 00:16:37,710
And in an instant, Misaki-kun gets past two players.

284
00:16:37,830 --> 00:16:38,710
Misaki-kun.

285
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:41,000
It's been three years since he came to France.

286
00:16:41,090 --> 00:16:44,130
His dazzling play has become even more fluid.

287
00:16:44,510 --> 00:16:46,220
Taro Misaki.

288
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:52,770
Misaki, in the three years spent here, has incorporated elegant French-style football into his game.

289
00:16:52,850 --> 00:16:55,560
He dribbles, getting past the midfielders and advancing.

290
00:16:55,640 --> 00:17:00,900
And now he passes, where is the pass going?

291
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:05,150
Are you being watched? What are you doing, Taro?

292
00:17:05,650 --> 00:17:07,740
I'd refused him before.

293
00:17:07,910 --> 00:17:13,660
After studying here, you will return to Japan to paint Mount Fuji.

294
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:18,880
If I join a team, returning won't be easy.

295
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:24,010
But if you join a club team, you can play high-level football.

296
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:28,680
Also, I don't know when we'll return to Japan.

297
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,010
Maybe I'll be in France.

298
00:17:30,090 --> 00:17:33,510
But still, I'm working hard so I can play at the national team level.

299
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:36,140
Because I made a promise.

300
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:38,520
As a member of the Japan team...

301
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:43,360
I will join forces with Tsubasa-kun and make Japan number one in the world.

302
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:45,860
Let's unite on the Japan team. Ozora Tsubasa.

303
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:48,070
Where is Misaki-kun's pass going?

304
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:51,410
Tsubasa-kun runs and receives the pass.

305
00:17:51,490 --> 00:17:53,030
Tsubasa! Misaki!

306
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:56,040
Under the French sky, they move in harmony and beautifully.

307
00:17:56,500 --> 00:17:59,790
Ozora Tsubasa-kun and Taro Misaki-kun.

308
00:17:59,870 --> 00:18:05,590
Nankatsu's Golden Duo returns as Japan's Golden Duo.

309
00:18:05,670 --> 00:18:06,760
Misaki-kun.

310
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,050
Tsubasa-kun.

311
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:09,430
Absolutely flawless.

312
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:13,390
As if there wasn't a 3-year gap between them.

313
00:18:13,470 --> 00:18:15,560
They are truly the Golden Duo.

314
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:17,350
Catch.

315
00:18:17,430 --> 00:18:20,400
The Golden Duo heads straight for the Italian goal.

316
00:18:20,940 --> 00:18:25,070
But the guardian of the Italian goal is Gino Hernandez-kun.

317
00:18:25,150 --> 00:18:27,610
Even if both of you come, there's only one goal.

318
00:18:27,690 --> 00:18:32,070
In the name of my perfect keeper nickname, I'll defend the goal at all costs.

319
00:18:32,490 --> 00:18:34,330
Just like Hernandez-kun.

320
00:18:34,410 --> 00:18:38,080
The Italian defenders haven't allowed any goals so far.

321
00:18:38,370 --> 00:18:41,460
Good, double-mark each one of them.

322
00:18:41,670 --> 00:18:42,580
Okay.

323
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:46,090
Immediately two players mark Tsubasa-kun.

324
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:49,720
Misaki-kun can't pass to him.

325
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:51,010
Tsubasa-kun...

326
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:54,850
And two players also mark Misaki-kun.

327
00:18:55,140 --> 00:18:56,260
Misaki-kun.

328
00:18:56,350 --> 00:18:59,100
I have no choice, I have to get through.

329
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:03,350
Incredible! He does it alone!

330
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:07,070
Oh, he did this in the one-on-one with Pierre too.

331
00:19:07,530 --> 00:19:08,570
Misaki.

332
00:19:08,780 --> 00:19:10,570
Yes, from here.

333
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:14,700
He finds a small gap and gets past both of them.

334
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:17,040
Now one-on-one with the goalkeeper.

335
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:25,340
Oh, Misaki-kun had broken free but tripped over a defender's foot and lost his balance.

336
00:19:25,590 --> 00:19:26,790
Misaki-kun!

337
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:30,170
Misaki-kun will definitely send his pass there.

338
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:36,600
Catch.

339
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:37,930
Tsubasa-kun!

340
00:19:38,010 --> 00:19:40,600
Misaki-kun sends a pass to Tsubasa-kun.

341
00:19:40,890 --> 00:19:43,520
But two players are marking Tsubasa-kun.

342
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:47,400
Tsubasa-kun! He jumps!

343
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:50,360
He gets free from the defenders and goes for the ball.

344
00:19:50,610 --> 00:19:51,490
Don't even think about it.

345
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:52,700
Impossible.

346
00:19:52,780 --> 00:19:54,990
He was just next to Misaki!

347
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:56,740
- Please, Hernandez. - Please, Hernandez.

348
00:19:57,080 --> 00:20:00,500
And here it comes, Tsubasa-kun's special move.

349
00:20:00,790 --> 00:20:03,000
The return shot!

350
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:04,500
I'll cut it off!

351
00:20:08,170 --> 00:20:09,000
What!?

352
00:20:09,130 --> 00:20:09,960
Misaki-kun!

353
00:20:10,050 --> 00:20:14,720
Tsubasa-kun doesn't do a return shot, instead he passes.

354
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:15,640
Great.

355
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:17,720
Misaki-kun is coming.

356
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:18,760
This goal.

357
00:20:18,850 --> 00:20:21,270
He jumps in the opposite direction from Hernandez-kun.

358
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:22,930
I won't allow it!

359
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:27,020
Hernandez-kun changes direction and jumps toward Misaki-kun.

360
00:20:27,900 --> 00:20:33,150
Stubbornly defending the goal until the last moment is one of Hernandez's traits.

361
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:36,160
They may be the Golden Duo,

362
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:40,030
but Hernandez also has a miraculous golden right hand.

363
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:43,250
I'll cut it off!

364
00:20:43,330 --> 00:20:44,410
Tsubasa-kun!

365
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:46,460
What?

366
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:51,170
Finally, this time Tsubasa-kun dives head-first for the ball.

367
00:20:52,590 --> 00:20:53,760
They've equalized!

368
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:58,430
Japan's Golden Duo scored the goal and it's 1-1.

369
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,560
We did it, Misaki-kun.

370
00:21:00,810 --> 00:21:01,810
Tsubasa-kun!

371
00:21:02,470 --> 00:21:04,890
They scored against Europe's number one goalkeeper,

372
00:21:04,980 --> 00:21:10,060
Gino Hernandez-kun, and equalized the score.

373
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:12,190
They did it, a tie!

374
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:13,570
Misaki-kun.

375
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:15,190
Tsubasa.

376
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:16,950
Taro.

377
00:21:17,410 --> 00:21:19,370
Your teamwork was great, Misaki-kun.

378
00:21:19,450 --> 00:21:21,370
Your shot was great too, Tsubasa-kun.

379
00:21:21,450 --> 00:21:23,080
We did it.

380
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:25,580
You did it, Tsubasa, Misaki.

381
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:28,540
We equalized, we finally got it.

382
00:21:28,750 --> 00:21:31,590
You were amazing, number 10, number 11.

383
00:21:31,670 --> 00:21:34,550
If you beat Italy, it will be a valuable victory.

384
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:39,800
This extraordinary goal was met with huge cheers from the crowd.

385
00:21:40,350 --> 00:21:42,310
That was a flawless goal.

386
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:46,810
You finally proved your talent in a match, Misaki.

387
00:21:47,190 --> 00:21:48,900
That was a great partnership.

388
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:52,320
Yes, but it can't reach the level of our partnership.

389
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:57,780
If Hernandez is the perfect keeper, then that shot was perfect.

390
00:21:57,900 --> 00:22:01,620
Without a doubt, Tsubasa and Misaki's performance was perfect.

391
00:22:02,410 --> 00:22:07,120
As long as we have these two, Japan will never lose.

392
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:49,870
Next episode: The Furious Tiger Awakens